ork or select work in  a way that  kind of cuts across  the categories that have structured that  collection and i really believe in that  work and i find it really powerful but  my worry about it is that it segregates  that kind of critical work and says that  this is the work of the artist the  institution kind of follows its own  um  kind of dynamic that is that's not a  part of that and so you end up  displaying these kinds of interventions  rather than incorporating them into the  practice of the museum  um i don't  so i'm i'm really interested in finding  way you know as a curator i was trying  to do that from within i'm now  working from without again but also very  much with museums and so i  my hope is that we start to really  yeah change change the way these objects  meaning is displayed in all these  different spaces  thanks  [Music]  you

